  "honesty": "Response = predicted drive + station turnout (LFB attendance is mobilise->arrive; travel-only scoring was wrong). Judged on LFB first-engine KPIs: mean <= 6 min, > 90% within 10 min. Drive comes from the chosen scorer (kolesar); new sites use the default turnout prior, existing houses a per-station estimate when available. Discrete candidates (existing houses + demand centroids); house sites are station-ground centroids, not surveyed. No land, zoning or staffing constraints. Station size (n_pumps) defaults from LFB two-pump inference (~40 stations with a second appliance). resize mode reallocates a fixed pump budget under a capacity-scaled busy model; other modes keep baseline pumps unless overridden. Busy blend applies when use_busy=True or mode=resize (location optimisation still uses nearest engine)."
